  "description": "The tyranny of the Empire has lasted a thousand years, and true martial arts is but a thing of the past. However, there are still heroes in the most unlikely of places— amongst the motley band of soldiers and outlaws who left the old continent for the New World. One such vigilante, the lone wanderer Janggeon, has the hope of restoring martial arts to its former glory… but is that such an easy thing as it seems?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
